Variable Annual_maintenance_f
Title: Annual maintenance fee rate
Units: %
Description: It is common for financial institutions to charge an annual maintenance fee on retirement accounts, as a percentage of account value. Fill this table in with the fees charged the financial institutions you are considering. ~
~
Annual maintenance fees can be significant, since they cut into your componding growth, and there are cases when they are as high as 2% for 401(k) accounts, so it is worth your time to look this up.
Definition: DetermTable(Account_type)(0,5m,5m,0.01)
