Chance Market_return
Title: Market return
Units: %
Description: The percent increase of the market (hence, of your investments) each year. Different investments will have different returns, so this represents an average return over the expected population of investments in your portfolio. This is an uncertain quantity, obviously, and hence is represented as a probability distribution.~
~
This assumes each year's distribution is statistically independent of other years' returns, and that all years follow the same distribution.
Definition: Uncertain_on_LMH( 	Annual_market_return + Adjustment_to_market,~
				pLow:10%,~
				over: Time )
