Variable Investment_total
Title: Investment total
Units: $
Description: Total investment value at the beginning of each time period, including unrealized gains.~
~
Beware that this is NOT the true value for you (except for the Roth IRA case), since you haven't yet withdrawn the money. When you withdraw your funds, additional taxes will be due.
Definition: Dynamic( Initial_investment_a, ~
	Self[Time-1] + Appreciation[Time-1] - Sum( Capital_gain_tax[Time-1], Gain_type )  - Annual_fees[Time-1] + Dividends[Time-1] - Tax_on_dividends[Time-1] )
