Module Intermediate_Capital
Title: Intermediate Capital gains
Description: Logic for tracking capital gains and capital gains taxes.~
~
A capital gain is the difference between the selling price and the purchase price of an investment. The model doesn't track individual investments. Instead, it tracks "unrealized gains", which is the increase in value in excess of the purchase price paid. Each time you sell an investment and purchase another, you "realize" the gain (hence decreasing unrealized gain).
Author: Lonnie Chrisman, Ph.D.~
Lumina Decision Systems
Date: Tue, Apr 10, 2018 3:45 PM
NodeLocation: 424,272,1
NodeSize: 64,24
DiagState: 2,56,45,842,434,17

