Decision Capital_gains_tax_ra
Title: Capital gains tax rate
Units: %
Description: The tax rate you pay on capital gains in a non-tax-deferred account (i.e., a normal brokerage). Of course, there isn't a single capital gains rate. Most people have a 15% rate on long-term gains and a short-term rate equal to their income tax rate.~
~
This should include both state and federal capital gains rates.
Definition: MultiTable(Gain_type)(Short_term_capital_g,Long_term_capital_ga,0)
