Variable Amount_sold
Title: Amount sold
Units: $
Description: The total dollar amount of investments sold during the year.~
~
This estimate is based on your trading turnover -- i.e., if you have a higher trading turnover, then you'll sell a higher percentage of your investments each year, if you have a lower trading turnover, you'll sell fewer.
Definition: Investment_total * Turnover
