Function Uncertain_on_LMH( quantiles : number [LMH,Run] ; pLow : optional number[Run]=0.1 ; lb,ub : optional number orNull[Run] ; over: ...optional named atom)
Title: Uncertain on LMH
Description: Same as the built-in UncertainLMH, except that instead of having 3 separate parameters for xLow, xMed, xHigh estimates, it accepts them as an array indexed by the LMH index.
Definition: UncertainLMH(~
	quantiles[LMH='Low'],~
	quantiles[LMH='Med'],~
	quantiles[LMH='High'],~
	pLow:pLow,~
	lb:lb,ub:ub )
