Variable Effective_value_over
Title: Effective value over time
Units: $
Description: This shows how much your portfolio is effectively worth to you, as it varies over time. ~
~
In contrast to Investment total, which shows your projected account balance over time, this adjusts that number to account for the fact that to access your money, you will eventually need to pay taxes, so this is a measure of the realistic value to you.
