Module Sensitivity_analysis
Title: Sensitivity analysis
Description: This module examines the sensitivity of the main result variable, Realized value at retirement, to each of the inputs. ~
~
The graphs for the slightly darker variable nodes:~
* Tornado for Realized Value at Retirement~
* Tornado for Realized Value at Retirement compared to 401k~
show the sensitivity in the form of a classic Tornado graph.~
~
The two objective nodes show the same sensitivity in an interactive panel where you can change the estimates and provide low and high ranges for the sensitivity analysis. The results of the sensitivity analysis are displayed in the same table.
Author: Lonnie Chrisman and Max Henrion~
Lumina Decision Systems
Date: Tue, Apr 10, 2018 3:45 PM
