Variable Maint_fee_subtable
Title: Maint fee subtable
Units: %
Description: The Low, Base and High values for the maint fee, which unlike the other sensitivity variables, varies by account type. It was separated out from the Sensitivity Low/High tables so that those tables don't need to have the Account_type index. This uses a MultiTable to merge the Low,High valus from the Maint_fee_range table with the Annual Maintenance fee rate table, which is used for the Base value.
Definition: MultiTable(LMH)(Maint_fee_range[ Domain of Account_type = Account_type],Annual_maintenance_f[ Domain of Account_type = Account_type ],Maint_fee_range[ Domain of Account_type = Account_type] )
