Variable Maint_fee_range
Title: Maint fee range
Units: %
Description: A place to hold the Low & High values for maintenance fee. This varies by Account_type, so it has its own table apart from the other sensitivity variables that don't vary by Account_type.
Definition: DetermTable(Account_type,LMH)(~
0,'unused',0,~
1m,'unused',0.01,~
1m,'unused',0.01,~
0,'unused',0.02)
