Variable Computed_sens_to_rea
Title: Computed sens to realized value rel mean
Units: $
Description: The change in value of realized value at retirement compared to the mean, when each input parameter is varied from low to high.~
~
The graph shows the sensitivity as a classic tornado plot, where the difference from the baseline is depicted, so that the center of the tornado is centered around 0.
Definition: Tornado_for_Realized - Mean(Realized_value_at_re);
