Variable Resulting_to_LMH_map
Title: Resulting to LMH map
Description: A map from the result columns to the LMH index for the Realized value at retirement sensitivity result. The "Resulting increase" column will depict the High value when there is a positive-monotonic relationship, but will depict the Low value when there is an inverse-monotonic relationship. This map takes care of swapping the columns depending on which way the relationship lands.
Definition: Table(Tornado_field)(Null,Null,Null,Null,ArgMin(Computed_sens_to_rea, LMH),ArgMax(Computed_sens_to_rea, LMH))
