Variable Tornado_for_Realized
Title: Tornado for Realized Value at Retirement
Units: $
Description: This result, in graph form, is the conventional tornado chart, showing the sensitivity of the Realized value at retirement to each input.
Definition: if LMH='Med' then Mean(Realized_value_at_re)~
else ~
~
	(LocalAlias v := Tornado_inputs;~
	 For level := LMH do ~
		if level='Mid' then null else ~
		  WhatIf( Mean(Realized_value_at_re), v, Sensitivity_ranges[Tornado_inputs=Handle(v),LMH=level] )) ~

