Variable Effective_value_at_r
Title: Effective value at retirement compared to 401k
Units: $
Description: The difference in net value at retirement of the Account_type and a 401(k) plan. A positive value means that the account type outperforms a 401(k) by the dollar amount shown. A negative value means that a 401(k) plan does better.
Definition: Effective_value_comp[Time=Years_to_retirement]
